---
description: Software factory pipeline and rules for this project
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses a software factory. Follow the rules in `AGENTS.md` (section "Software factory").

To run a station, read its playbook in `.factory/stations/` and follow it:
intake (`new.md`), `spec.md`, `design.md`, `plan.md`, `build.md`, `verify.md`, `review.md`, `ship.md`, `autopilot.md`.

When the user says "factory" or asks what to do next, follow `.factory/stations/factory.md`.
